---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactButton from '../components/ContactButton.astro';
---

<Layout title="Bio | Chef Gurbaj">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-heading mb-8 border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/20 pb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-obsidian-black via-slate-grey to-obsidian-black dark:from-[#d4af37] dark:via-[#fcf5d2] dark:to-[#d4af37] bg-[length:200%_auto] bg-clip-text text-transparent animate-gradient-wave">
      The <span>Journey</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12">
      <div class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-p:text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey prose-headings:text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white max-w-none lg:w-2/3">
        <p class="text-xl font-light leading-relaxed mb-12">
          I am a high-performing Executive Chef offering deep restaurant experience. 
          My talent lies in building streamlined, cohesive teams and maintaining absolute focus and productivity 
          in high-volume, fast-paced operations. From sourcing premium ingredients to controlling budgets and 
          boosting restaurant profiles, I am dedicated to creating seamless, unforgettable dining experiences.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mt-12 mb-6">The Culinary Journey</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            My career has been defined by high-impact roles at industry-leading organizations such as <strong class="text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white font-medium">Tim Hortons</strong>, where I honed my expertise in product development and operational excellence. I specialize in frozen food research and development, successfully formulating recipes and optimizing processing techniques to develop products with an extended 6-month shelf life, all while preserving uncompromising quality and food safety.
          </p>
          <p>
            Beyond the research lab, I have extensive hands-on experience in industrial bakery manufacturing, overseeing high-volume production lines yielding over 100,000 breads daily. This scale of operation requires a meticulous approach to consistency, efficiency, and quality control throughout the entire production lifecycle.
          </p>
          <p>
            Throughout my career, I have forged strong partnerships with premier global food ingredient and beverage solution brands, including <span class="italic text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white">Monin, NewTaste, DaVinci Gourmet, Chattha Foods,</span> and <span class="italic text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white">Vista Processed Foods</span>. These collaborations have driven forward product innovation, ingredient application, and commercial menu development.
          </p>
          <p>
            My comprehensive understanding of retail and FMCG commercialization encompasses everything from ready-to-eat solutions to delivery-friendly packaging functionality. By integrating product development with manufacturing and operations, I create scalable, commercially successful food concepts tailored for cafés, QSRs, restaurants, and industrial food production.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-16 text-center lg:text-left">
          <ContactButton text="Get In Touch" intent="general" />
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Cinematic Image Side Panel -->
      <div class="hidden lg:block lg:w-1/3">
        <div class="sticky top-24 reveal">
          <div class="relative overflow-hidden elite-glass rounded-sm shadow-2xl p-2">
            <img src="/images/cafe_raw_materials_1785772861508.jpg" alt="Premium Cafe Ingredients" class="w-full h-[600px] object-cover rounded-sm" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-obsidian-black/80 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6">
              <p class="text-saffron-gold font-heading text-xl italic m-0">"Respect the ingredient."</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
